<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In SketchPlan: Diffusion Based Drone Planning From Human Sketches" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
